# Iteration Planning

Use this directory for iteration plans, sprint plans, and slice sequencing artifacts.

## Recommended naming

- `ITER-*`
- `iteration-plan-*`
- `sprint-plan-*`

## Each artifact should make clear

- iteration goal
- entry and exit criteria
- sequence of slices
- owner and review date

## Layer rule

- this directory belongs to `MetaDefineLayer`
- keep live execution status in `TASK_STACK.md`, `PIPELINE.md`, or `STATE.md`
